howl-report 2
profile el
verdict inconclusive
termination fixpoint
rounds 4
inconsistent false
omitted 1
omission ClassAssertion(ObjectOneOf(http://example.org/t#a) http://example.org/t#b)
unsatisfiable 0
subsumptions 14
sub http://example.org/t#A1 http://example.org/t#A1
sub http://example.org/t#A1 http://example.org/t#A2
sub http://example.org/t#A1 http://example.org/t#B
sub http://example.org/t#A1 http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://example.org/t#A2 http://example.org/t#A2
sub http://example.org/t#A2 http://example.org/t#B
sub http://example.org/t#A2 http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://example.org/t#B http://example.org/t#B
sub http://example.org/t#B http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://example.org/t#C http://example.org/t#C
sub http://example.org/t#C http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://example.org/t#D http://example.org/t#D
sub http://example.org/t#D http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
sub http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing http://www.w3.org/2002/07/owl#Thing
exit 2
